Cell["\<\
Testes usando a fun\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o fractal de Weierstrass\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.556633069501789*^9, 3.556633096686833*^9}, {
   3.556879585204369*^9, 3.556879591772325*^9}, 3.5568851828954477`*^9, 
